<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Key engineering decisions</h2>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#5a9100]">01</span>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]"><strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Unify the data before automating anything:</strong> Predictive maintenance is only as good as the data feeding it&mdash;consolidating work order, inventory, and equipment data came first.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#5a9100]">02</span>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]"><strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Predict, don't just report:</strong> A dashboard that shows what already broke is less useful than a model that flags what's about to.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#5a9100]">03</span>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]"><strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Integrate with what's already running:</strong> Standard protocol support for PLCs and SCADA systems meant manufacturers didn't have to replace hardware to adopt Gaamma.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

